{"rpid": "261918390", "root": "6090034", "parent": "6090034", "uname": "认真地装随便", "mid": "20042137", "level": 4, "vip": 0, "content": "大部分国家以人民的血汗税金作担保，去发债，再以iou，再以印钞形式，去保资本家和自己利益。\n所以我恨银行", "like": 0, "ctime": 1495120489, "rcount": 0, "ip": "", "images": [], "video_aid": "504471", "video_bvid": "BV1Jx411c7SM", "video_title": "什么是比特币？ What is Bitcoin", "video_desc": "自制字幕+U2B源 比特币小介绍", "video_owner": "KoharuHiyori", "video_view": 6363, "video_reply": 50, "video_n1": 12, "video_n2": 38}
